        {
          "source": "t05-g034-turn-1",
          "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
          "text": "I changed two things about the kitchen bin this week. It still smells when I lift the lid, but there's no puddle at the bottom now.",
          "sha": "bf21c31e36084e2e98d236505826fd575a83ba7f2d55fc6d84ca053ba75e80d8",
          "onsetTail48k": [
            7192,
            15708
          ],
          "role": "dialogueTurn",
          "range48k": [
            216000,
            597600
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "t05-g034-turn-2",
          "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
          "text": "Which change stopped the puddle? I thought you'd opened the vents in the lid.",
          "sha": "41f1b3ea4c9c6467b9926b86249e77673d7b48403b957a5042de8ae10cd8cffa",
          "onsetTail48k": [
            9489,
            39545
          ],
          "role": "dialogueTurn",
          "range48k": [
            597600,
            839400
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "t05-g034-turn-3",
          "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
          "text": "I didn't open them until today. The bottom's been dry since I started lining it with plain paper on Monday. Today the paper is already damp, though the bottom underneath it is dry.",
          "sha": "9b541a734aea6f8b377397f5b5fb8d735cd176f125b3aa9c191af89dd47bac97",
          "onsetTail48k": [
            8942,
            15318
          ],
          "role": "dialogueTurn",
          "range48k": [
            839400,
            1403400
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "t05-g034-turn-4",
          "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
          "text": "Then the paper is catching the liquid. Let's keep using it. We don't know yet whether the vents help with the smell. We should check that separately before we change anything else.",
